	(text "AMP LEFT - TAS5805M (U301), BTL, ch A = woofer, ch B = tweeter"
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.048 3.048)
				(thickness 0.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cc522868-5598-45df-85bd-75ecf53f68d3")
	)
	(text "Design notes"
		(at 20.32 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "23403f74-cf17-488a-8154-8589e64750a7")
	)
	(text "I2C address 0x2C (7-bit): R301 = 4.7k ADR/FAULT strap to DVDD (+3V3). amp_right: R401 = 15k -> 0x2D. Pin 3 is also FAULTZ -> AMPL_FAULT_N (merged on mcu sheet)."
		(at 20.32 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "41f489ca-f49b-4914-a1de-29e0299479c8")
	)
	(text "PVDD = 18.0 V (boost, power sheet); DVDD = +3V3. AVDD (5 V) and VR_DIG (1.5 V) are internal regulator outputs: cap only, no other load."
		(at 20.32 242.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8169ab1f-4f56-47a4-b90e-959fe7603cd2")
	)
	(text "Output LC per leg: 10 uH (FXL0630-100-M, Isat 5.5 A) + 1 uF 50 V X7R to GND -> BTL f0 ~ 50 kHz. Fsw = 768 kHz (FSW_SEL = 000), Hybrid modulation."
		(at 20.32 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5dfc0287-c696-478d-a9a2-4c472778fff9")
	)
	(text "Ch A = woofer J301, 8 ohm (ND65-8): DRC/AGL at max 15.5 V pk. Ch B = tweeter J302, 4 ohm (OT19NC00-04): limiter max 8 V pk after crossover is MANDATORY (OCP 5 A)."
		(at 20.32 250.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a94c7254-5102-4979-b7c8-1568562a0443")
	)
	(text "Layout: C304 + C302/C303 at pins 15/16, C307 + C305/C306 at pins 27/28 (100 nF within 1 mm), C301 between groups. Bootstrap C312-C315 straight BST to OUT, top layer, no vias."
		(at 20.32 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "abda1fcf-b2d6-4963-a362-c794d2f8e3ff")
	)
	(text "Speaker terminals are BTL and float at ~PVDD/2: never tie either terminal to GND. SDOUT (pin 9) not used."
		(at 20.32 257.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6f8da3ea-166c-45c2-a35a-658dfc241032")
	)
	(text "PVDD decoupling (100 nF closest to pins 15/16 and 27/28)"
		(at 139.7 68.58 0)
